Given the file layout (`app.js` mounts `sessionUser` then the two routers), the natural place is a single middleware mounted once in `app.js`, not sprinkled into each route handler.

**Where to mount it**

```js
app.use(express.json());        // app.js:7
app.use(requestLogger);         // NEW — before sessionUser
app.use(sessionUser);           // app.js:11
app.use("/accounts", accounts); // app.js:13
app.use("/orders", orders);     // app.js:14
```

