const row = await db.write(
  "UPDATE accounts SET display_name = $1, billing_email = $2 WHERE id = $3 RETURNING *",
  [req.body.display_name, req.body.billing_email, req.user.accountId]
);
```
Bind `req.user.accountId` (not `req.params.id`) in the query itself, so even if the guard were ever skipped or refactored away, the query can't touch another tenant's row.

