Two things it doesn't cover, worth deciding explicitly:
- The `PATCH /accounts/:id` handler itself should still guard `deleted_at IS NULL` in its own `WHERE` (belt-and-suspenders, and covers any future admin/service path that bypasses `sessionUser`).
- Existing orders placed before deletion — decide whether they stay readable for records/billing (probably yes) vs. new writes being blocked (yes, via the join above).

